// Kept by hand (the importer no longer writes this file).
// The original has no table of unit abilities (most are flag bits, the rest attack-type fields),
// so `num` is our own. The numbers are frozen: the code, a saved game and the text tables
// refer to an ability by its number. A new ability is appended with the next free number. `id` is the alias for human editing.
